WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:27.910
[The Joy of Life Season 2]

01:27.910 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 4]

01:39.340 --> 01:40.900
I knew you were still alive!

01:40.900 --> 01:42.520
Everyone said that you were dead.

01:42.540 --> 01:43.900
Why does it feel like it's been
a few years since I saw you?

01:43.900 --> 01:45.140
Lower your volume.

01:47.820 --> 01:50.080
Didn't you go to Northern Qi
as a diplomat?

01:50.100 --> 01:52.420
Why are you back
before the diplomatic corps?

01:53.620 --> 01:54.700
Did you get in trouble?

01:54.900 --> 01:56.780
Are you the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House?

01:58.980 --> 02:00.220
You can tell?

02:00.420 --> 02:02.780
I should've focused on the ledger.

02:03.460 --> 02:04.580
Stand right there.

02:04.780 --> 02:05.980
Look at me.

02:07.180 --> 02:08.900
Let me ask you this one more time.

02:09.620 --> 02:12.420
Is the Baoyue Pleasure House
your property?

02:13.500 --> 02:15.760
No need to grind your teeth.

02:15.780 --> 02:17.600
It's no use, even if you are envious.

02:17.620 --> 02:19.660
Even brothers should
keep it strictly business.

02:20.060 --> 02:21.320
Let me put it this way, Xian.

02:21.340 --> 02:22.600
In this place,

02:22.620 --> 02:25.320
every brick and every blade of grass

02:25.340 --> 02:27.720
is mine.

02:27.740 --> 02:29.900
The Baoyue Pleasure House is

02:30.060 --> 02:32.460
the property of the Fan family.

02:32.620 --> 02:34.300
Why did you establish this?

02:34.740 --> 02:36.660
I want to make money.
What else can it be?

02:37.500 --> 02:38.620
Look at yourself.

02:38.620 --> 02:40.580
You are the fine one to talk.

02:41.140 --> 02:42.760
Our bookstore was doing well.

02:42.780 --> 02:44.040
But you left it behind
for the Northern Qi.

02:44.060 --> 02:45.000
How did you say the word again?

02:45.020 --> 02:46.100
Updates.

02:46.140 --> 02:47.560
You stopped updating.

02:47.580 --> 02:48.900
Readers were demanding updates.

02:48.900 --> 02:49.740
What was I supposed to do?

02:49.740 --> 02:51.420
"Red Mansion" was left unfinished.

02:51.500 --> 02:52.900
Do our family know about this?

02:53.940 --> 02:55.640
They don't.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.880
I'm preparing this

02:56.900 --> 02:58.380
as a surprise for them.

02:58.660 --> 03:01.360
So this is all your idea?

03:01.380 --> 03:02.700
No one forced you?

03:03.900 --> 03:05.160
What's wrong with you?

03:05.180 --> 03:06.760
Making money is a good thing.

03:06.780 --> 03:08.460
Why must anyone force me to do this?

03:09.220 --> 03:10.360
Why don't you tell me about you?

03:10.380 --> 03:12.040
I'm curious about

03:12.060 --> 03:14.420
what you have been busy with
in the Northern Qi for so long.

03:15.020 --> 03:16.100
I...

03:18.900 --> 03:19.780
Are you insane?

03:19.780 --> 03:21.100
Why are you beating me?

03:21.380 --> 03:22.880
Is there anyone else upstairs?

03:22.900 --> 03:23.840
Strange.

03:23.860 --> 03:25.500
Isn't just Mr. Fan alone upstairs?

03:25.500 --> 03:26.980
What is the noise about?

03:28.780 --> 03:30.320
Every blade of grass, huh?

03:30.340 --> 03:31.840
Every brick, huh?

03:31.860 --> 03:32.920
They are all yours.

03:32.940 --> 03:34.420
All yours.

03:34.620 --> 03:36.100
All yours.

03:36.900 --> 03:38.460
You are dead!

03:54.580 --> 03:55.660
I...

03:55.740 --> 03:56.900
Not this.

04:00.180 --> 04:01.460
Fan Xian.

04:02.900 --> 04:04.880
My father has never beaten me so hard.

04:04.900 --> 04:06.020
How dare you!

04:07.180 --> 04:10.180
Baoyue Pleasure House is yours?

04:10.740 --> 04:12.040
It's mine. Any problem?

04:12.060 --> 04:13.180
Are you jealous?

04:13.340 --> 04:15.320
What about Jin?

04:15.340 --> 04:17.580
What Jin? I don't know him.

04:17.700 --> 04:19.220
Don't you confuse me.

04:19.580 --> 04:21.480
You have been bothering me
for a long time.

04:21.500 --> 04:22.760
Who do you think you are?

04:22.780 --> 04:23.780
Believe it or not,
I'm going to get someone

04:23.780 --> 04:25.660
to break your legs!

04:26.460 --> 04:27.780
I haven't called anyone yet.

04:47.140 --> 04:48.340
Fan Sizhe.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.220
You can save yourself the trouble.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.660
Let me tell you this.

04:54.620 --> 04:56.300
I snuck back here,

04:56.580 --> 04:57.860
and I'm in huge trouble.

04:59.700 --> 05:00.920
Go and tell everyone

05:00.940 --> 05:02.560
that Fan Xian is here,

05:02.580 --> 05:03.680
and I'm done for.

05:03.700 --> 05:04.560
It's worse than losing my legs.

05:04.580 --> 05:06.100
Probably, I would lose my life.

05:06.260 --> 05:08.040
Don't play the victim with me.

05:08.060 --> 05:09.480
Do you think I dare not call them?

05:09.500 --> 05:11.440
Fine. I will wait here.

05:11.460 --> 05:13.360
You should avenge yourself.

05:13.380 --> 05:13.920
Go on.

05:13.940 --> 05:15.240
Fine...

05:15.260 --> 05:16.340
You are dead meat.

05:17.260 --> 05:18.800
Wait here. Don't move.

05:18.820 --> 05:20.420
Men, hurry!

05:21.340 --> 05:22.700
Come over!

05:23.460 --> 05:25.220
We are here, Mr. Fan.

05:25.340 --> 05:27.780
Someone beat me up.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.700
Who did that?

05:29.700 --> 05:31.420
Come over.

05:31.460 --> 05:32.760
Is everyone here?

05:32.780 --> 05:34.300
Just a few of you?

05:34.340 --> 05:36.000
Where are my 300 warriors?

05:36.020 --> 05:37.140
Gather them here.

05:37.340 --> 05:38.160
Gather them!

05:38.180 --> 05:41.100
What's wrong? Is it about the ledgers?

05:42.180 --> 05:43.480
What's wrong with you?

05:43.500 --> 05:44.240
Mr. Fan,

05:44.260 --> 05:46.360
whose leg you want to break?

05:46.380 --> 05:47.540
It's F...

05:47.780 --> 05:49.460
Who?

05:50.820 --> 05:51.340
What?

05:51.340 --> 05:52.560
Who is it?

05:52.580 --> 05:54.600
Frigging table leg.

05:54.620 --> 05:56.000
Frigging table?

05:56.020 --> 05:57.480
The table?

05:57.500 --> 05:59.460
What table?

06:02.820 --> 06:04.900
I tripped over the table just now.

06:05.380 --> 06:06.460
Tomorrow,

06:06.620 --> 06:08.140
make it into a tea table.

06:10.700 --> 06:11.180
Tea table?

06:11.180 --> 06:12.260
Move.

06:13.340 --> 06:14.420
Uh...

06:28.380 --> 06:29.700
Where are your men?

06:33.820 --> 06:35.020
You said

06:35.340 --> 06:36.880
if I called someone up here,

06:36.900 --> 06:38.300
you would die.

06:38.500 --> 06:39.480
Is that true?

06:39.500 --> 06:40.580
It's true.

06:47.180 --> 06:48.860
So I saved your life.

06:50.340 --> 06:51.580
I will let you slide this time.

06:51.780 --> 06:53.140
Don't get excited just yet.

06:53.380 --> 06:54.540
I'm still mad at you.

06:54.560 --> 06:56.000
Who are you to beat me?

06:58.700 --> 06:59.780
Hey.

07:03.340 --> 07:04.460
What's wrong with you?

07:05.580 --> 07:06.660
Nothing.

07:07.780 --> 07:11.300
I have had an issue
with my qi flow lately.

07:11.700 --> 07:13.340
I was very worked up just now,

07:13.780 --> 07:15.020
and it got messed up again.

07:16.580 --> 07:18.360
Why did you get worked up?

07:18.380 --> 07:19.540
I'm sorry about that.

07:19.820 --> 07:21.340
Gosh, why am I even apologizing?

07:25.260 --> 07:27.660
Did you take the Tengs away?

07:28.380 --> 07:29.460
What?

07:30.020 --> 07:31.100
Who?

07:31.940 --> 07:33.460
Teng Zijing's widow.

07:34.260 --> 07:36.980
Where would I take her?
To the Baoyue Pleasure House?

07:37.460 --> 07:38.380
Impossible.

07:38.380 --> 07:40.140
I was also tight with Teng.

07:40.140 --> 07:41.880
Why would I do that?

07:41.900 --> 07:43.020
You don't know?

07:43.380 --> 07:43.920
Wait.

07:43.940 --> 07:46.460
Who told you she is here?

07:46.460 --> 07:47.440
Do you have proof?

07:47.460 --> 07:48.660
Someone saw that.

07:49.500 --> 07:50.240
I will check with them.

07:50.260 --> 07:51.340
Come back.

07:53.700 --> 07:56.220
Do you know about the prostitution here?

07:58.340 --> 07:59.380
What nonsense are you talking about?

07:59.380 --> 08:00.900
Don't be ridiculous.

08:01.020 --> 08:03.180
Baoyue Pleasure House
is a place of elegance and artistry.

08:03.180 --> 08:04.460
Isn't this a brothel?

08:05.820 --> 08:07.040
You are so infuriating.

08:07.060 --> 08:08.660
Let me make this clear to you.

08:09.500 --> 08:12.700
Do you think the Baoyue Pleasure House
is a brothel?

08:12.780 --> 08:15.440
Think about this. There are
quite a few established brothels

08:15.460 --> 08:17.120
in the Capital.

08:17.140 --> 08:19.240
This isn't a good venture for us.

08:19.260 --> 08:20.680
Plus, we are new in this industry.

08:20.700 --> 08:21.800
There is no way

08:21.820 --> 08:22.480
we can steal their business.

08:22.500 --> 08:24.760
So we must find another way.

08:24.780 --> 08:27.120
Even if it's true,

08:27.140 --> 08:29.360
if people were to find out

08:29.380 --> 08:30.560
that the Fan family
runs a brothel business,

08:30.580 --> 08:31.980
Father would beat me to a pulp.

08:32.660 --> 08:34.720
What about those ladies?

08:34.740 --> 08:35.720
Yes, they work here.

08:35.740 --> 08:37.240
But it's definitely not

08:37.260 --> 08:39.220
what you think.

08:39.220 --> 08:40.240
Don't get the wrong idea.

08:40.260 --> 08:42.120
They are not in the flesh market.

08:42.140 --> 08:43.120
Those ladies I hired

08:43.140 --> 08:44.480
must be

08:44.500 --> 08:45.880
knowledgeable, well-mannered, talented,

08:45.900 --> 08:47.760
and well-versed in the four arts

08:47.780 --> 08:49.360
and literature.

08:49.380 --> 08:52.480
After all, sexual favors lack decency.

08:52.500 --> 08:53.480
My goal

08:53.500 --> 08:54.600
is to make the Baoyue Pleasure House

08:54.620 --> 08:57.400
the only serene haven

08:57.420 --> 09:00.000
in this bustling Capital,

09:00.020 --> 09:01.960
where those scholarly folks

09:01.980 --> 09:05.780
could find their confidante here.

09:05.860 --> 09:07.640
That is the uniqueness

09:07.660 --> 09:09.300
I want.

09:12.140 --> 09:14.900
Do you know anything
about the death of Jin?

09:15.740 --> 09:17.140
You kept talking about this Jin.

09:17.140 --> 09:19.020
Who exactly is he?

09:19.220 --> 09:20.480
Did he die here?

09:20.500 --> 09:21.860
My business just started.

09:21.860 --> 09:23.780
He can't affect my business.

09:23.900 --> 09:25.880
Does my competitor do this to ruin me?

09:25.900 --> 09:27.420
I will confront with them!

09:42.500 --> 09:44.900
Hasn't anyone entered Mr. Fan's room?

09:44.980 --> 09:46.180
No.

09:46.900 --> 09:48.780
And he slipped himself?

10:32.620 --> 10:33.700
What's wrong?

10:34.100 --> 10:36.020
I came to check your wound.

10:36.500 --> 10:37.960
Why didn't you come sooner?

10:37.980 --> 10:39.140
I was waiting for a while,

10:39.140 --> 10:40.740
in case I disturb you.

10:43.220 --> 10:45.420
Well, I'm good.

10:46.100 --> 10:47.000
You may leave.

10:47.020 --> 10:48.260
No need to see me off.

10:49.900 --> 10:51.060
Do you need my help?

10:52.500 --> 10:53.900
Yes.

10:54.260 --> 10:54.780
Please tell.

10:54.780 --> 10:55.860
Hold on.

10:58.500 --> 10:59.520
I was thinking about

10:59.540 --> 11:02.140
the fallacy

11:02.540 --> 11:03.620
you talked about.

11:04.020 --> 11:06.420
It does make some sense.

11:07.780 --> 11:10.380
Sitting here and
checking the ledgers alone

11:10.620 --> 11:12.540
is quite boring.

11:14.100 --> 11:15.180
You see,

11:15.300 --> 11:18.140
you got smart after the trip.

11:19.140 --> 11:20.220
I'm getting it.

11:21.220 --> 11:22.300
Well,

11:22.620 --> 11:24.140
there was a tall lady

11:25.140 --> 11:27.900
playing the pipa just now.

11:28.140 --> 11:29.120
Is she still here?

11:29.140 --> 11:30.540
Bring her up here

11:30.900 --> 11:32.540
to play songs

11:32.860 --> 11:34.000
for me.

11:34.020 --> 11:36.540
It's good to have a pretty lady
by your side.

11:37.020 --> 11:38.200
Just the pipa player?

11:38.220 --> 11:39.620
Do you need the whole band?

11:40.140 --> 11:41.300
No,

11:41.420 --> 11:42.620
just the pipa.

11:43.140 --> 11:44.260
Wait for me.

11:45.220 --> 11:46.300
No need to see me off.

11:57.660 --> 11:59.600
[Baoyue Pleasure House]
Don't forget what I told you.

11:59.620 --> 12:00.620
Smile more.

12:00.620 --> 12:01.900
Don't make any mistakes.

12:01.900 --> 12:03.080
Understood?

12:03.100 --> 12:04.740
Whether or not you succeed

12:04.740 --> 12:06.660
depends on your performance today.

12:08.500 --> 12:10.000
No mistakes.

12:10.020 --> 12:11.100
All right.

12:14.780 --> 12:15.860
Let me check.

12:15.900 --> 12:16.980
Pretty good.

12:24.500 --> 12:25.580
Come in.

12:33.620 --> 12:34.700
What are you doing?

12:37.740 --> 12:39.240
We can manage without you.

12:39.260 --> 12:40.340
I will call you

12:40.500 --> 12:41.740
once it's finished.

12:59.780 --> 13:00.880
Am I busted?

13:00.900 --> 13:02.880
You are. Go down.

13:02.900 --> 13:04.020
No need to see me off.

13:17.020 --> 13:18.100
Xian.

13:18.660 --> 13:20.260
Come and sit.

13:24.740 --> 13:25.820
Is it her?

13:26.380 --> 13:28.180
Sang Wen. Miss Sang.

13:28.860 --> 13:29.940
Miss Sang.

13:33.300 --> 13:34.740
May I ask you something?

13:34.780 --> 13:37.500
What kind of place
is the Baoyue Pleasure House?

13:39.500 --> 13:41.620
A brothel, of course.

13:44.220 --> 13:45.880
How could it be a brothel?

13:45.900 --> 13:48.540
You are the owner. Don't you know?

13:49.020 --> 13:51.600
Xian, I really don't know.

13:51.620 --> 13:53.520
Yuan Meng operates this place
all on her own.

13:53.540 --> 13:56.020
Don't you come here often?

13:56.860 --> 13:58.760
I only come to check the ledgers.

13:58.780 --> 14:00.420
I wouldn't intervene much.

14:00.980 --> 14:02.620
I'm not interested
in the entertainment industry.

14:05.300 --> 14:06.660
Let me ask you this, Miss Sang.

14:07.300 --> 14:08.620
Is it true

14:08.900 --> 14:10.820
that there is prostitution here?

14:11.540 --> 14:13.140
They're locked up in the backyard.

14:14.980 --> 14:16.760
Xian, I will get to the bottom of this.

14:16.780 --> 14:18.060
You?

14:18.380 --> 14:19.220
Of course.

14:19.220 --> 14:20.140
I have been deceived.

14:20.140 --> 14:20.860
I'm also the victim.

14:20.860 --> 14:21.720
You are the owner.

14:21.740 --> 14:23.660
How will you extricate yourself
from this?

14:23.860 --> 14:25.140
If I can't...

14:25.380 --> 14:26.020
Well, if you two investigate...

14:26.020 --> 14:27.100
Can you two sit closer?

14:27.100 --> 14:28.300
You are tiring me out.

14:30.500 --> 14:31.660
Fan Sizhe,

14:33.260 --> 14:34.660
well done, huh?

14:35.140 --> 14:38.020
Every brick and every blade of grass
is yours.

14:38.100 --> 14:39.120
Your property.

14:39.140 --> 14:40.000
No.

14:40.020 --> 14:41.100
Xian.

14:41.660 --> 14:43.200
I admit

14:43.220 --> 14:44.360
I may have

14:44.380 --> 14:46.380
bragged a little just now.

14:47.380 --> 14:48.460
Tell me now.

14:48.500 --> 14:50.020
Where did you hire Yuan Meng from?

14:50.140 --> 14:51.120
Not me.

14:51.140 --> 14:52.540
Aren't you the owner here?

14:52.900 --> 14:54.820
I'm not the only owner.

14:55.620 --> 14:56.740
Who else?

14:59.260 --> 15:00.400
[Li Chengping, Third Prince]
Have we been making money lately?

15:00.420 --> 15:01.940
Of course.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.760
I knew it.

15:03.780 --> 15:04.760
How much?

15:04.780 --> 15:06.480
The first owner is checking the ledgers.

15:06.500 --> 15:08.420
Do you want to go inside?

15:08.540 --> 15:09.620
My cousin is here?

15:10.900 --> 15:11.880
Cousin?

15:11.900 --> 15:14.020
The second owner is your cousin?

15:14.620 --> 15:17.540
Our mothers are relatives.

15:18.020 --> 15:19.300
Which family?

15:19.380 --> 15:20.460
The imperial family.

15:21.900 --> 15:23.540
He is from the imperial family.

15:23.780 --> 15:26.820
Concubine Yi and my mother
are cousins.

15:26.900 --> 15:27.980
So Her Highness's son

15:27.980 --> 15:29.420
should be my cousin,

15:29.420 --> 15:30.540
right?

15:30.620 --> 15:32.540
Concubine Yi's son?

15:32.780 --> 15:33.880
Third Prince?

15:33.900 --> 15:34.760
He is my cousin.

15:34.780 --> 15:35.400
Well...

15:35.420 --> 15:36.740
Mr. Fan,

15:36.900 --> 15:38.500
I think I should leave.

15:38.540 --> 15:39.620
Where are you going?

15:40.100 --> 15:41.120
I can't hear this anymore.

15:41.140 --> 15:43.540
The more I know,
the shorter my life becomes.

15:44.380 --> 15:45.360
Just sit down.

15:45.380 --> 15:46.480
You have heard

15:46.500 --> 15:47.840
everything.

15:47.860 --> 15:49.020
It's too late.

15:56.100 --> 15:57.940
The color of this drape
doesn't seem right,

15:57.980 --> 15:59.420
especially the streamer.

16:00.220 --> 16:02.780
What color do you think fits?

16:03.380 --> 16:04.400
Maybe blue.

16:04.420 --> 16:05.540
Sure.

16:05.660 --> 16:06.900
Oh no.

16:07.420 --> 16:08.500
Pink is better.

16:09.020 --> 16:10.500
We will go with pink.

16:10.780 --> 16:12.300
Purple isn't bad either.

16:12.660 --> 16:14.140
Should we change to purple?

16:14.860 --> 16:16.840
Why not have all three colors

16:16.860 --> 16:18.120
and mix them into black?

16:18.140 --> 16:19.240
It seems black at first glance.

16:19.260 --> 16:20.420
When you take a closer look,

16:20.500 --> 16:22.380
you will see blue, pink, and purple.

16:25.740 --> 16:27.820
Change it to iridescent pitch black.

16:30.380 --> 16:31.880
Change the candlestick too.

16:31.900 --> 16:32.840
It doesn't look good.

16:32.860 --> 16:33.940
Change it.

16:33.980 --> 16:36.600
Change it to a sturdier stand.

16:36.620 --> 16:37.700
All right.

16:42.260 --> 16:45.420
With some dainty, delicate sense.

16:49.380 --> 16:51.420
Change it to
a thick yet thin candlestick.

16:54.900 --> 16:56.140
Mr. Li,

16:56.380 --> 16:58.080
Mr. Fan is upstairs
checking the ledgers.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.880
Do you want to go upstairs?

16:59.900 --> 17:01.140
No hurry.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.840
Operating the Baoyue Pleasure House

17:02.860 --> 17:04.140
isn't about making money.

17:04.260 --> 17:05.400
Most importantly,

17:05.420 --> 17:06.740
we have to make a fortune.

17:13.180 --> 17:15.260
Did you understand what he just said?

17:17.500 --> 17:19.500
Making a living isn't easy nowadays.

17:20.660 --> 17:21.940
You don't understand?

17:27.020 --> 17:28.340
I will start from the beginning.

17:33.500 --> 17:35.440
Actually, he is doing this
for his ego.

17:35.460 --> 17:36.540
Ego?

17:37.420 --> 17:39.560
He doesn't care what business he's in,

17:39.580 --> 17:41.000
as long as it's lucrative.

17:41.020 --> 17:42.500
If he can make money,

17:42.500 --> 17:45.080
it proves that he is discerning,
capable, and effective.

17:45.100 --> 17:46.240
And his mother

17:46.260 --> 17:48.240
will be proud of him.

17:48.260 --> 17:49.160
Wait.

17:49.180 --> 17:50.480
He runs a brothel

17:50.500 --> 17:52.000
to make his mother proud?

17:52.020 --> 17:52.940
Is he sick in the head?

17:52.940 --> 17:53.520
No, Xian.

17:53.540 --> 17:54.540
Like I said,

17:54.540 --> 17:55.500
my cousin and I

17:55.500 --> 17:57.020
are the victims of this fraud.

17:57.020 --> 17:59.300
We didn't know the Baoyue Pleasure House
was involved in that.

17:59.340 --> 18:00.980
Didn't Concubine Yi ask anything?

18:01.940 --> 18:02.840
My cousin wants

18:02.860 --> 18:04.700
to give his mother a surprise
just like I do.

18:07.740 --> 18:09.560
Where did he hire Yuan Meng?

18:09.580 --> 18:10.640
Search me.

18:10.660 --> 18:12.940
Why are you fixated on Yuan Meng?

18:12.940 --> 18:14.700
- You are still not getting it?
- This one.

18:14.980 --> 18:16.580
These two colors are very similar.

18:16.580 --> 18:18.800
Change the red one

18:18.820 --> 18:19.900
to

18:20.580 --> 18:21.320
purple.

18:21.340 --> 18:22.620
Change it.

18:22.780 --> 18:23.400
Wait.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.180
That one.

18:24.180 --> 18:25.240
Is it him?

18:25.260 --> 18:26.500
All right.

18:26.980 --> 18:27.960
All right.

18:27.980 --> 18:29.060
This.

18:29.100 --> 18:29.920
This isn't right either.

18:29.940 --> 18:31.300
Change it to purple.

18:31.420 --> 18:31.980
No,

18:31.980 --> 18:34.060
that color seems a bit heavy.
That won't do.

18:34.860 --> 18:36.480
There is a lot of improvement to make.

18:36.500 --> 18:38.320
I will gather everything
and tell you later.

18:38.340 --> 18:39.420
All right.

18:40.740 --> 18:42.020
Is Sizhe upstairs?

18:42.340 --> 18:43.560
Mr. Fan is thorough.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.380
He is checking the ledgers alone.

18:45.740 --> 18:46.560
Checking the ledgers alone?

18:46.580 --> 18:48.300
A pipa player is with him.

18:48.460 --> 18:50.340
Sizhe doesn't like listening to songs.

18:50.540 --> 18:52.100
Let's go and take a look.

18:55.780 --> 18:57.220
Slow down.

19:03.300 --> 19:05.380
Sizhe, I'm coming in.

19:06.260 --> 19:07.340
Come on in.

19:14.020 --> 19:15.000
Aren't you listening to songs?

19:15.020 --> 19:16.300
Why are you playing instead?

19:16.780 --> 19:18.380
Argh, you remind me of that.

19:18.740 --> 19:20.700
How did you teach the players?

19:20.860 --> 19:22.860
I can play better than her.

19:23.260 --> 19:24.580
Go back and practice more.

19:31.980 --> 19:33.380
What did I tell you just now?

19:33.500 --> 19:35.020
How could you mess this up?

19:37.860 --> 19:38.980
Leave right now.

19:42.780 --> 19:45.760
When I was the top courtesan
at the Liujing River,

19:45.780 --> 19:48.640
I played the pipa the best.

19:48.660 --> 19:49.740
Get up!

19:51.260 --> 19:52.340
Go down.

19:53.060 --> 19:55.740
Give me a shout
if you want to listen to my playing.

19:58.260 --> 19:59.640
Xian, I play that too.

19:59.660 --> 20:00.760
I can sing for you.

20:00.780 --> 20:02.000
Don't mess around.

20:02.020 --> 20:03.980
Where did you hire her?

20:07.780 --> 20:10.540
Who are you?

20:28.340 --> 20:30.260
Is everyone here?

20:30.660 --> 20:31.500
Yes, Your Highness.

20:31.500 --> 20:38.420
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

20:40.420 --> 20:41.920
Are you sure Fan Xian is inside?

20:41.940 --> 20:42.760
Absolutely.

20:42.780 --> 20:44.340
Come in with me.

20:45.020 --> 20:46.560
Your Highness, I...

20:46.580 --> 20:48.680
Don't hesitate.

20:48.700 --> 20:50.180
People who plan an escape

20:50.180 --> 20:52.060
always end up being trapped.

20:52.260 --> 20:53.440
Yes, Your Highness.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.320
Very clever.

20:54.340 --> 20:55.240
Let's go

20:55.260 --> 20:56.460
and enjoy the show.

21:17.540 --> 21:18.780
Did you kill him?

21:19.060 --> 21:20.160
He just fainted.

21:20.180 --> 21:21.080
So easily?

21:21.100 --> 21:22.780
I'm an expert after all.

21:23.340 --> 21:25.320
Well... How's your qi flow?

21:25.340 --> 21:26.540
It recovers after some rest.

21:27.980 --> 21:29.180
How am I going to explain

21:29.180 --> 21:30.020
when he wakes up?

21:30.020 --> 21:31.540
He saw your face.

21:34.940 --> 21:36.380
Answer me. What's wrong?

21:55.300 --> 21:56.860
What are these people doing here?

21:56.980 --> 21:58.620
Why did the Second Prince come here?

21:59.260 --> 22:00.700
He's here for me.

22:01.580 --> 22:02.820
Did he know you were here?

22:17.580 --> 22:19.100
Heads-up.

22:19.580 --> 22:21.420
The entire building has been besieged.

22:21.420 --> 22:22.980
You have no way out.

22:24.020 --> 22:27.220
Don't ever think about
escaping through the window or roof.

22:28.100 --> 22:29.700
Open the door and welcome him.

22:29.780 --> 22:31.280
But you can't show your face.

22:31.300 --> 22:33.780
We can't shut a prince out
with a mere door, so open the door.

22:44.580 --> 22:45.700
Your Highness.

22:52.500 --> 22:53.580
Young Master.

22:53.740 --> 22:55.100
How have you been?

22:55.500 --> 22:57.700
Wang, why are you here?

22:58.460 --> 22:59.820
So many people here.

23:06.820 --> 23:08.020
What is this?

23:10.580 --> 23:12.200
He was sleepy, so he took a nap.

23:12.220 --> 23:13.300
And this?

23:15.100 --> 23:16.260
A donkey kicked me.

23:23.220 --> 23:24.340
Fan Xian,

23:25.980 --> 23:27.540
long time no see.

23:29.700 --> 23:31.060
It wasn't long.

23:32.180 --> 23:34.220
It was less than

23:34.460 --> 23:35.520
half a year.

23:35.540 --> 23:36.660
But it feels like

23:36.660 --> 23:38.780
two or three years have passed.

23:39.020 --> 23:40.580
The Capital was no fun

23:41.060 --> 23:42.240
without you.

23:42.260 --> 23:43.540
You know what?

23:43.700 --> 23:45.240
On my way to Northern Qi,

23:45.260 --> 23:47.100
Yan Xiaoyi intended to kill me.

23:47.980 --> 23:49.060
Really?

23:50.220 --> 23:52.080
I have been curious about

23:52.100 --> 23:54.260
how he knew about my trip.

23:55.100 --> 23:56.640
I didn't tell anyone

23:56.660 --> 23:58.000
which route I took.

23:58.020 --> 23:59.160
Then how did he find out?

23:59.180 --> 24:00.700
It's simple, actually.

24:00.740 --> 24:03.060
If he knew the route I didn't take,

24:03.100 --> 24:04.980
he could figure out.

24:05.280 --> 24:06.680
The trip to Northern Qi is long,

24:06.680 --> 24:07.700
and there are checkpoints along the way,

24:07.720 --> 24:09.910
which were operated by your men.

24:10.500 --> 24:13.260
If I didn't travel through
the Fengming Pass or take a detour,

24:13.500 --> 24:15.060
which route would I choose?

24:15.660 --> 24:17.620
Isn't that a no-brainer?

24:19.540 --> 24:20.980
So

24:21.020 --> 24:23.540
the one who collaborated
with the Eldest Princess to kill me

24:23.540 --> 24:25.380
has been you all along.

24:33.260 --> 24:34.340
Fan Xian,

24:34.780 --> 24:36.260
in fact,

24:37.300 --> 24:40.020
you can easily find out
about human trafficking

24:40.220 --> 24:41.460
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

24:41.780 --> 24:44.760
Both of the owners are here.

24:44.780 --> 24:45.740
So is the Immortal Poet, Fan,

24:45.741 --> 24:46.780
who faked his death
and returned to the Capital.

24:46.780 --> 24:48.780
Things can't be clearer than it is now.

24:49.980 --> 24:50.840
Yes,

24:50.860 --> 24:54.000
no one would believe me
if I said I had nothing to do

24:54.020 --> 24:55.460
with the Baoyue Pleasure House.

24:55.780 --> 24:57.760
In fact, up to this point,

24:57.780 --> 25:00.020
human trafficking
is no longer important.

25:00.180 --> 25:01.240
Fan Xian,

25:01.260 --> 25:02.920
you faked your death
and deceived the emperor.

25:02.940 --> 25:05.540
This is a solid capital offense.

25:08.700 --> 25:09.780
But

25:10.020 --> 25:12.000
I still have to thank Mr. Wang Qinian.

25:12.020 --> 25:14.020
Without his help,

25:14.420 --> 25:15.940
I wouldn't have met you.

25:17.740 --> 25:19.060
Wang has always been

25:20.020 --> 25:21.300
very helpful.

25:26.980 --> 25:28.760
Wang.

25:28.780 --> 25:31.060
You betrayer!

25:34.980 --> 25:36.060
Your Highness,

25:36.580 --> 25:40.500
now that Mr. Fan is in your hands,

25:40.860 --> 25:42.980
as we agreed,

25:44.100 --> 25:46.980
please return my wife and daughter.

25:47.300 --> 25:48.780
They are not with me.

25:49.260 --> 25:51.000
But you gave me your word.

25:51.020 --> 25:52.820
I told you very clearly.

25:53.500 --> 25:55.540
I offer you anything I have,

25:56.420 --> 25:58.540
but your family isn't with me.

25:58.700 --> 26:01.100
I sent my men to fetch them,

26:01.180 --> 26:02.460
but it was too late.

26:03.020 --> 26:04.460
The house was empty.

26:04.780 --> 26:06.960
Are you sure they are not with you?

26:06.980 --> 26:08.300
Positive.

26:09.780 --> 26:11.020
Don't panic.

26:11.260 --> 26:12.766
Once this is over,

26:12.786 --> 26:14.386
I will help you search for them.

26:15.700 --> 26:17.260
Where could they go?

26:37.125 --> 26:40.745
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

26:52.780 --> 26:53.860
Mr. Fan.

26:55.780 --> 26:57.940
I thought His Highness had seized them.

27:00.220 --> 27:01.300
I understand.

27:01.740 --> 27:03.620
Honestly, I find this rather strange.

27:04.020 --> 27:05.540
Someone took his family away

27:05.860 --> 27:07.080
but didn't make any demands.

27:07.100 --> 27:08.860
Yeah. Unlike you, huh?

27:09.300 --> 27:11.540
You use human lives as leverage.

27:13.660 --> 27:15.100
This doesn't matter.

27:15.300 --> 27:16.220
Up till now,

27:16.220 --> 27:18.620
I'm kind of moved by my kindness.

27:19.660 --> 27:21.540
Even in a situation like this,

27:21.780 --> 27:23.740
I'm still thinking of offering you
an olive branch.

27:24.220 --> 27:25.720
If you agree,

27:25.740 --> 27:27.480
I will release the Tengs

27:27.500 --> 27:28.960
and write off

27:28.980 --> 27:30.100
the scores
of the Baoyue Pleasure House.

27:32.180 --> 27:33.560
Are you suggesting

27:33.580 --> 27:34.800
that I beg for your forgiveness?

27:34.820 --> 27:36.160
It's the same.

27:36.180 --> 27:38.960
It's natural for human beings
to make mistakes.

27:38.980 --> 27:41.700
Let it go. Don't dwell on it.

27:42.500 --> 27:43.760
Let it go?

27:43.780 --> 27:45.100
How?

27:46.220 --> 27:47.980
What about the justice for the victims
of human trafficking and prostitution?

27:47.980 --> 27:50.000
Who should be held accountable?

27:50.020 --> 27:51.080
Who?

27:51.100 --> 27:52.240
You.

27:52.260 --> 27:54.180
You brought this harm to them.

27:54.580 --> 27:55.840
I don't give a fig about them.

27:55.860 --> 27:57.320
All I care about is you.

27:57.340 --> 27:58.500
As long as you become my ally,

27:58.500 --> 28:00.740
you can decide their fates, right?

28:01.180 --> 28:02.260
Two options.

28:02.780 --> 28:04.220
Either we reconcile,

28:04.940 --> 28:06.020
or

28:06.260 --> 28:07.500
I will kill you.

28:14.820 --> 28:15.980
Point taken.

28:19.300 --> 28:21.260
I will not reconcile with you.

28:21.300 --> 28:23.320
Li Chengze,
we don't belong to the same kind.

28:23.340 --> 28:25.340
We are destined to be enemies!

28:32.500 --> 28:33.620
What a bummer.

28:43.260 --> 28:45.540
This is the Capital Magistrate.
Drop your weapon.

28:51.220 --> 28:52.300
Stay still.

28:52.500 --> 28:53.580
Stay still.

28:54.220 --> 28:55.300
No one is moving.

29:04.100 --> 29:05.020
You are already dead.

29:05.020 --> 29:07.500
How did you manage to summon
the Capital Magistrate officers here?

29:08.780 --> 29:09.680
No.

29:09.700 --> 29:11.940
You couldn't summon them
even if you hadn't died.

29:12.580 --> 29:13.860
Who could it be?

29:17.780 --> 29:20.300
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:20.940 --> 29:21.960
Back to your work.

29:21.980 --> 29:23.060
Rise.

29:48.820 --> 29:50.060
Chengze, you are here too.

29:51.220 --> 29:52.980
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:58.060 --> 30:00.180
We are brothers. Drop the formalities.

30:02.020 --> 30:03.220
Shall we

30:03.700 --> 30:04.780
talk?

30:10.660 --> 30:11.780
Rise.

30:17.020 --> 30:18.180
Your Highness.

30:22.980 --> 30:24.840
What's wrong with him?

30:24.860 --> 30:26.540
He was tired. He's taking a nap.

30:28.100 --> 30:29.200
Sleeping like that?

30:29.220 --> 30:31.300
He is a growing boy, so he sleeps a lot.

30:32.060 --> 30:33.480
I used to be like this when I was young.

30:33.500 --> 30:34.000
I understand.

30:34.020 --> 30:35.300
Understand, my foot.

30:37.460 --> 30:38.760
What happened to your face?

30:38.780 --> 30:39.940
A donkey kicked him.

30:41.820 --> 30:43.820
You do know everything, Chengze.

30:49.500 --> 30:52.780
What brings you a place this like,
Your Highness?

30:52.860 --> 30:53.780
I was free.

30:53.800 --> 30:56.160
I saw the magistrate officers
had a case, so I followed them.

30:56.180 --> 30:57.540
What case?

30:58.020 --> 30:59.220
The Baoyue Pleasure House.

30:59.300 --> 31:01.280
Human trafficking is a serious crime.

31:01.300 --> 31:02.640
I must come and take a look.

31:02.660 --> 31:05.220
I didn't expect to run into you here.

31:05.500 --> 31:08.060
Why don't you come again tomorrow?

31:09.020 --> 31:11.540
You better think twice.

31:12.260 --> 31:13.540
Think what?

31:13.740 --> 31:14.520
How?

31:14.540 --> 31:16.020
Fan Xian deceived the emperor,

31:16.780 --> 31:18.260
which is a capital offense.

31:18.940 --> 31:20.780
Do you want to defend him?

31:20.980 --> 31:22.460
Isn't he already dead?

31:23.860 --> 31:25.540
Then who is this guy?

31:33.980 --> 31:35.560
Chengze, don't scare me.

31:35.580 --> 31:37.220
No one is in front of me.

31:44.260 --> 31:46.060
Think about the repercussions.

31:46.420 --> 31:48.820
You will face the same charge
for defending a capital offender.

31:49.180 --> 31:50.080
Lately,

31:50.100 --> 31:51.460
I have been tired.

31:51.500 --> 31:53.520
I can't see or listen.

31:53.540 --> 31:54.980
Why would I face charges?

32:02.220 --> 32:04.220
If this gets out of hand,

32:05.020 --> 32:07.020
do you think you can protect him?

32:10.580 --> 32:11.520
I don't know.

32:11.540 --> 32:12.780
Let's try.

32:16.940 --> 32:18.480
The Capital Magistrate is on duty.

32:18.500 --> 32:20.820
Anyone who obstructs
will be executed as a traitor.

32:22.020 --> 32:24.060
Haven't you considered

32:24.780 --> 32:25.760
how this will end?

32:25.780 --> 32:26.760
I have never thought about it.

32:26.780 --> 32:27.560
Why don't you think about it?

32:27.580 --> 32:28.980
Pardon me for asking,

32:29.260 --> 32:30.020
how did you know

32:30.020 --> 32:32.740
I would come here today?

32:40.660 --> 32:42.080
Wang Qinian?

32:42.100 --> 32:43.760
Your... Your Highness.

32:43.780 --> 32:45.440
If someone has to be blamed,

32:45.460 --> 32:47.820
it must be Mr. Fan.

32:48.180 --> 32:51.380
I'm kind in nature.

32:52.660 --> 32:54.560
Did Fan Xian go to
the Baoyue Pleasure House?

32:54.580 --> 32:55.660
Yes.

32:56.180 --> 32:58.040
Are you going
to Chengze's residence later?

32:58.060 --> 32:59.480
Mr. Fan said

32:59.500 --> 33:02.400
as long as you seize the right timing,

33:02.420 --> 33:05.260
you could corner him
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

33:09.340 --> 33:11.800
Fan Xian is using himself as the bait?

33:11.820 --> 33:15.340
Hopefully, you enjoy fishing.

33:18.420 --> 33:19.740
A trap within another trap?

33:19.940 --> 33:21.280
I was outfoxed.

33:21.300 --> 33:22.700
It's all because

33:22.700 --> 33:24.760
of the devious Mr. Fan.

33:24.780 --> 33:27.240
I had no choice.

33:27.260 --> 33:28.740
If I did seize your wife and daughter,

33:28.740 --> 33:30.860
I would've handed them
over to you earlier.

33:31.580 --> 33:32.660
Luckily,

33:33.180 --> 33:35.480
they aren't in your hands.

33:35.500 --> 33:37.020
It's safer.

33:37.260 --> 33:38.480
What a trick you used to get my answer.

33:38.500 --> 33:39.920
What a huge web you cast.

33:39.940 --> 33:41.960
You flattered me.

33:41.980 --> 33:42.760
Wang Qinian.

33:42.780 --> 33:44.180
You are a natural at fraud.

33:44.180 --> 33:45.240
You managed to fool me.

33:45.260 --> 33:46.640
Are you a habitual fraud?

33:46.660 --> 33:49.180
Not at all.

33:49.300 --> 33:53.160
I always keep on
the straight and narrow.

33:53.180 --> 33:55.160
I was affected

33:55.180 --> 33:56.460
by Mr. Fan.

33:58.020 --> 33:59.100
Chengze.

33:59.220 --> 34:00.320
They have drawn their swords.

34:00.340 --> 34:01.520
Why are you chatting?

34:01.540 --> 34:03.060
Did they draw their swords?

34:07.100 --> 34:09.460
No? Well, let's sit and chat a little.

34:19.580 --> 34:21.500
You said we are brothers.

34:22.260 --> 34:23.720
Plus, you are the Crown Prince.

34:23.740 --> 34:26.040
If I pull out a sword in your presence,
isn't that treason?

34:26.060 --> 34:28.160
Just consider that a joke.

34:28.180 --> 34:29.680
Because we are brothers,

34:29.700 --> 34:31.200
you have to heed my advice.

34:31.220 --> 34:33.360
You shouldn't have come
to the Baoyue Pleasure House.

34:33.380 --> 34:34.640
People might gossip

34:34.660 --> 34:36.160
if they see you here.

34:36.180 --> 34:37.820
The owner here

34:37.980 --> 34:39.260
is the Fan family.

34:39.860 --> 34:41.060
But the second owner

34:41.060 --> 34:42.560
is this young brother of yours.

34:42.580 --> 34:44.860
He is also your young brother.

34:44.860 --> 34:46.400
Chengze, you are mistaken.

34:46.420 --> 34:48.800
The crown prince isn't considered
among the princes.

34:48.820 --> 34:49.840
He is younger than me.

34:49.860 --> 34:50.880
He's our third brother.

34:50.900 --> 34:51.800
So no one will hold me accountable

34:51.820 --> 34:53.160
for what he has done.

34:53.180 --> 34:54.960
Why? Are you going to run me in today?

34:54.980 --> 34:55.920
Don't say that.

34:55.940 --> 34:57.240
You are my brother.

34:57.260 --> 34:58.400
After I step out of this room,

34:58.420 --> 34:59.600
I won't mention a word.

34:59.620 --> 35:01.680
How should I repay you?

35:01.700 --> 35:03.500
Release the Tengs.

35:03.980 --> 35:05.460
I thought Fan Xian wasn't here.

35:05.580 --> 35:07.100
That was my inner voice.

35:10.820 --> 35:12.060
To be honest,

35:12.540 --> 35:14.180
I wouldn't care
if things got out of control.

35:14.740 --> 35:16.100
The Baoyue Pleasure House

35:16.260 --> 35:17.800
has nothing to do with me after all.

35:17.820 --> 35:20.380
I won't be bothered
even if people gossip.

35:20.700 --> 35:22.400
The Baoyue Pleasure House
has nothing to do with you?

35:22.420 --> 35:23.600
My conscience is clear.

35:23.620 --> 35:24.320
Are you sure?

35:24.340 --> 35:25.420
Very sure.

35:25.420 --> 35:26.440
Shall we continue this conversation
somewhere else?

35:26.460 --> 35:27.660
Sure.

35:41.140 --> 35:42.660
Is the woman downstairs Yuan Meng?

35:43.060 --> 35:45.220
What are they talking about?
I can't hear.

35:45.780 --> 35:46.860
I don't know.

35:47.460 --> 35:48.540
Don't look at them.

35:49.140 --> 35:51.200
She was once a famous courtesan
in the Liujing River.

35:51.220 --> 35:53.100
If I'm not mistaken,

35:53.140 --> 35:55.060
Hongcheng took her in.

35:55.940 --> 35:57.620
Hongcheng is Prince Jing.

35:57.620 --> 35:58.700
But I'm not familiar

35:58.700 --> 35:59.960
with him.

35:59.980 --> 36:01.700
Chengze, you are
quite familiar with him.

36:01.780 --> 36:05.060
I can safely say
he is at your beck and call.

36:06.940 --> 36:08.500
Just get to the point.

36:10.080 --> 36:12.240
The relationship between you guys.

36:12.460 --> 36:14.180
Yuan Meng and Hongcheng.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.980
Hongcheng and you.

36:16.780 --> 36:18.640
It's a trio, no?

36:20.800 --> 36:21.920
To outsiders,

36:21.940 --> 36:23.660
you do have some relations

36:23.680 --> 36:24.960
with the Baoyue Pleasure House.

36:24.980 --> 36:27.100
That's far-fetched.

36:27.120 --> 36:27.960
Unless someone delves into it.

36:27.980 --> 36:29.700
What if they can't find anything?

36:29.720 --> 36:31.240
Rumors can kill.

36:31.680 --> 36:32.740
Just say it.

36:32.760 --> 36:34.820
What do you want from me?

36:40.300 --> 36:42.280
Release the Tengs,

36:42.300 --> 36:43.760
that's what I want.

36:43.867 --> 36:46.567
Do you think

36:47.600 --> 36:49.420
I will compromise so easily?

36:56.300 --> 36:58.080
You are absolutely right.

36:58.100 --> 36:59.420
I will.

37:14.780 --> 37:15.860
In the end,

37:16.060 --> 37:17.740
we are brothers.

37:17.780 --> 37:19.620
We are family.

37:19.980 --> 37:22.300
It doesn't matter who compromises.

37:22.780 --> 37:23.860
Fan Wujiu.

37:24.300 --> 37:25.380
Your Highness.

37:25.820 --> 37:28.140
Send the Tengs home.

37:29.300 --> 37:29.700
Uh...

37:29.700 --> 37:30.780
Now.

37:32.420 --> 37:33.500
Yes.

37:43.980 --> 37:46.940
Move aside! Get out of the way!

37:51.060 --> 37:52.500
Do you have any orders?

37:53.860 --> 37:54.840
Don't worry.

37:54.860 --> 37:56.800
I will definitely release them.

37:56.820 --> 37:58.760
I fear rumors.

37:58.780 --> 38:00.240
Do you have any orders, Chengze?

38:00.260 --> 38:01.300
Since you are here,

38:01.300 --> 38:03.227
I'm better off admitting defeat.

38:03.247 --> 38:04.400
May I

38:04.420 --> 38:05.780
leave now?

38:08.380 --> 38:09.460
Off you go.

38:13.540 --> 38:14.980
You can never tell with people.

38:15.060 --> 38:16.340
I wish you good luck.

38:19.820 --> 38:21.300
Who was he talking to?

38:21.540 --> 38:22.620
I don't know.

38:41.780 --> 38:42.800
The Capital Magistrate is on duty.

38:42.820 --> 38:44.300
Don't make trouble.

38:46.660 --> 38:48.060
Let's leave.

39:00.980 --> 39:02.260
What are you thinking about?

39:03.460 --> 39:05.420
Do you think he really means it?

39:09.237 --> 39:11.040
From what I know about Chengze,

39:11.060 --> 39:12.760
he is a man of his word.

39:12.780 --> 39:14.640
He promised to release the Tengs,

39:14.660 --> 39:16.300
and he will.

39:18.740 --> 39:21.320
He compromised too quickly.

39:21.340 --> 39:22.460
Even though he was at a disadvantage,

39:22.460 --> 39:24.900
he could've left immediately.

39:24.940 --> 39:26.340
But he agreed to release
the Tengs so easily.

39:28.460 --> 39:29.920
Probably, it's because

39:29.940 --> 39:32.040
I mentioned the trio.

39:32.060 --> 39:33.600
He also thought

39:33.620 --> 39:34.380
people might suspect

39:34.380 --> 39:35.840
that he is related

39:35.860 --> 39:37.240
to the Baoyue Pleasure House.

39:37.260 --> 39:38.340
Right?

39:39.420 --> 39:41.140
Yuan Meng

39:41.300 --> 39:43.140
is a glaring error.

39:46.540 --> 39:48.740
Perhaps I arrived early,

39:49.260 --> 39:50.860
and he didn't have the time to hide her.

39:51.060 --> 39:53.240
No, what I mean is,

39:53.260 --> 39:54.260
why did he arrange

39:54.260 --> 39:55.640
Yuan Meng to run
the Baoyue Pleasure House?

39:55.660 --> 39:56.900
Couldn't he find someone else?

39:56.920 --> 39:58.920
Yuan Meng was a top courtesan.

39:58.940 --> 40:00.180
She has her people skills.

40:00.180 --> 40:02.580
That makes her
perfect for this role, right?

40:05.540 --> 40:08.260
He used the Baoyue Pleasure House
to frame Fan Sizhe,

40:08.660 --> 40:09.760
sent me a letter,

40:09.780 --> 40:11.180
and captured the Tengs.

40:11.180 --> 40:12.980
He went to great lengths,

40:13.620 --> 40:15.140
but now he just compromised.

40:16.340 --> 40:17.780
He probably

40:17.940 --> 40:19.840
wanted to capture you
for deceiving the emperor.

40:19.860 --> 40:21.060
Little did he know

40:21.260 --> 40:23.300
that his plan fell short.

40:25.940 --> 40:26.780
Is it possible

40:26.780 --> 40:29.300
that Yuan Meng is the mistake
he purposely shows us?

40:35.700 --> 40:37.100
What is his motive, then?

40:41.060 --> 40:42.180
What is his motive?

40:45.420 --> 40:46.940
Indeed.

40:47.780 --> 40:49.260
What is his motive?

41:13.340 --> 41:14.420
Have you released them?

41:14.660 --> 41:16.100
I had someone to release them.

41:16.180 --> 41:18.080
Don't scare the widow and her son.

41:18.100 --> 41:20.120
Are we really
sending the Tengs back like that?

41:20.140 --> 41:22.120
We couldn't arrest Fan Xian,
so let them be.

41:22.140 --> 41:24.360
Besides, it's not worth it
to risk ourselves for this.

41:24.380 --> 41:25.240
But we didn't gain

41:25.260 --> 41:26.840
anything at all.

41:26.860 --> 41:27.760
Patience.

41:27.780 --> 41:29.840
The show of the Baoyue Pleasure House
just started.

41:29.860 --> 41:31.780
He thought he had won.

41:31.820 --> 41:33.180
What about Wang Qinian?

41:35.060 --> 41:37.340
He got me good.

41:38.100 --> 41:39.580
Impressive.

41:42.620 --> 41:44.280
You flatter me.

41:44.300 --> 41:46.040
I'm not.

41:46.060 --> 41:48.080
I'm just an ordinary man.

41:48.100 --> 41:50.240
Your Highness,
I don't deserve this compliment.

41:50.260 --> 41:52.460
You are quite humble.

41:53.660 --> 41:55.160
Anyway, not many could

41:55.180 --> 41:55.880
fool Chengze.

41:55.900 --> 41:57.700
Well done.

41:59.340 --> 42:02.200
It's mainly because you are fortunate.

42:02.220 --> 42:05.800
And thanks to Mr. Fan's wise plan.

42:05.820 --> 42:06.720
I'm just

42:06.740 --> 42:09.740
playing my part as an honest man.

42:09.820 --> 42:12.180
That's why I could
accomplish it so well.

42:12.180 --> 42:14.240
Wang, that's enough.

42:14.260 --> 42:15.340
All right.

42:15.660 --> 42:16.980
What are you going to do

42:17.100 --> 42:18.580
with the Baoyue Pleasure House?

42:20.260 --> 42:22.380
Can you release the ladies?

42:24.980 --> 42:26.660
If I release them now,

42:26.940 --> 42:29.100
I guess none will stay alive.

42:33.140 --> 42:34.580
Shut down the building
for the time being.

42:35.980 --> 42:37.260
You appease them.

42:37.580 --> 42:38.440
Once I've returned the Capital properly,

42:38.460 --> 42:39.840
I will help these ladies.

42:39.860 --> 42:40.940
All right.

42:41.260 --> 42:42.040
Oh, right.

42:42.060 --> 42:43.680
There is a lady
with the surname Jin here.

42:43.700 --> 42:44.640
Look after her well.

42:44.660 --> 42:46.260
Return the indenture to her.

42:48.660 --> 42:50.260
You shouldn't let Wan'er down.

42:50.820 --> 42:52.240
The business is doing quite well.

42:52.260 --> 42:54.460
Do you really want to close it down?

42:55.060 --> 42:56.080
I dare not continue it.

42:56.100 --> 42:57.600
Aren't you intrepid?

42:57.620 --> 42:58.940
I wouldn't cross the boundary.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.153 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
